# desktop -- a normal PC, and nothing more.
#
# KDE Plasma on Wayland, a terminal worth using, and Firefox as a Flatpak.
# No office suite, no mail client, no media player, no games: anything else
# you want is `flatpak install`, which keeps it out of the base image.
#
# dnf is present (it is Fedora) but note it does NOT persist on a bootc host.
# For an rpm with no Flatpak, use `rpm-ostree install` and reboot.
00-core
10-shell
30-desktop-plasma
40-flatpak
